# Wrath Remix's prologue (STORY.md), played by CI as a new Timerunner (auth_check.py script, on the
# Remix realm): waking at the Infinite Bazaar, Eternus and the echoes of the war's dead, Alurmi and
# the class instructor, the anomalies, a purchase from the Bronze vendors, and Eternus sending the
# Timerunner to Valiance Keep. The anomalies are killed with a game master's `.damage` (the
# character's blows, so it gets the kills).

cmd .remix
expect chapter 0 (the prologue)

# The opening (RemixIntro.cpp): a new Timerunner's first moments are at the Broken Front in
# Icecrown, beside Tirion against the Scourge, until the Lich King comes and time stops; then
# Moratari brings them to the Bazaar.
wait 8
cmd .gps
expect The Broken Front
wait 92
expect Frostmourne hungers
cmd .gps
expect Crystalsong Forest

# The starter kit and the class's abilities, a moment after the first login (the client checks
# what the realm wrote down at the end).
wait 3

# Moratari's Hourglass is in the bags from the first moment; turned at the Bazaar before the
# Timerunner has come to it from anywhere, it has nowhere to take them back to.
cmd .remix hourglass
expect Wrath Remix hourglass: bag 255
use-hourglass
expect come here from nowhere yet

# WRM-010, Out of Time: Moratari, before the waking Timerunner, sends them to Eternus (both within
# reach from here).
go 571 5697.5 1019.5 175.0
talk 770001
expect quest 77010
accept 770001 77010
reward 770002 77010
expect rewarded 77010

# WRM-011, What the War Will Cost: the three echoes, every one of them heard.
talk 770002
expect quest 77011
accept 770002 77011
go 571 5691.0 1029.0 175.1
talk 770021
expect credit 77011 770021
go 571 5700.0 1032.0 175.1
talk 770022
expect credit 77011 770022
go 571 5709.0 1029.0 175.1
talk 770023
expect credit 77011 770023
go 571 5697.5 1019.5 175.0
reward 770002 77011
expect rewarded 77011

# WRM-012, Time's Toll: Alurmi and the warrior's instructor, then Moratari (the hearthstone remembers
# the Bazaar).
talk 770002
expect quest 77012
accept 770002 77012
go 571 5686.0 1042.5 175.0
talk 770005
expect credit 77012 770005
go 571 5679.0 986.5 175.0
talk 770101
expect credit 77012 770033
# Report Time Anomaly, from the game's menu (the app's add-on): the realm writes a report of the
# quest the Timerunner is on, who they've spoken to since they took it and the way they came, for
# the app to send to GitHub (the server test reads it).
addon WowRemix report CI's report, from the Bazaar
expect Time anomaly reported
go 571 5697.5 1019.5 175.0
reward 770001 77012
expect rewarded 77012

# WRM-013, A Small Demonstration: Moratari lets the anomalies through, one at a time (each one
# killed brings the next, three in all).
talk 770001
accept 770001 77013
talk 770001
expect Let the anomalies through
select 770001 anomalies
expect through the seams
# (a moment for each to come through)
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 1/3
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 2/3
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 3/3
wait 2
cmd .remix guid 770031
expect no creature 770031
reward 770001 77013
expect rewarded 77013

# Alurmi, and from her vendor window a heirloom the warrior's kit hasn't got, for 300 Bronze
# (ItemExtendedCost 7708). (How much Bronze the Timerunner has by now isn't checked: the prologue
# gives plenty, and more is better.)
go 571 5686.0 1042.5 175.0
talk 770005
expect Bronze
select 770005 Heirlooms
expect ware 42985 cost 7708
buy 770005 42985
expect bought 42985

# The Bazaar's other Bronze vendors, as a warrior sees them: Horos's mounts, Durus's tier sets (a
# warrior's pieces, not a mage's) and a legendary, paid for with Bronze a game master gives.
go 571 5677.0 1042.5 175.0
talk 770201
expect Mounts of Northrend
select 770201 Mounts of Northrend
expect ware 50818 cost 7726
go 571 5641.5 1042.0 175.0
talk 770205
expect Legendaries
select 770205 Tier 10, Icecrown Citadel (25 heroic)
expect ware 51227
talk 770205
select 770205 Tier 10, Icecrown Citadel (25 heroic)
expect-not ware 51280
cmd .remix bronze add 20000
talk 770205
select 770205 Legendaries
buy 770205 46017
expect bought 46017

# WRM-014, To the Front: Moratari's, answered by Eternus, who sends the Timerunner to Valiance Keep,
# before Recruitment Officer Blythe and Enlistment Day.
go 571 5697.5 1019.5 175.0
talk 770001
expect quest 77014
accept 770001 77014
reward 770002 77014
expect rewarded 77014
wait 3
cmd .remix
expect chapter 1
talk 25307
expect quest 11672

# Moratari's Hourglass: from Valiance Keep to the Bazaar, and back to Valiance Keep.
use-hourglass
wait 2
cmd .gps
expect Crystalsong Forest
cmd .remix hourglass
expect way back map 571 at 229
use-hourglass
wait 2
cmd .gps
expect Borean Tundra

# Borean Tundra's creatures at Chapter I's levels, and squished: three quarters of the health of
# their level.
cmd .remix band
expect band: Borean Tundra
cmd .remix band
expect at 75% of their level's health
